hon's sequence types", "file": "07-low-level-arrays.md", "words": 2564}, {"id": "dynamic-arrays", "title": "Dynamic arrays and amortised analysis", "file": "08-dynamic-arrays.md", "words": 2679}, {"id": "using-arrays", "title": "Using arrays: insertion sort, ciphers and 2-D data", "file": "09-using-arrays.md", "words": 2893}], "problems": ["dsaf-dynamic-array", "dsaf-insertion-sort", "dsaf-caesar-cipher"]}, {"id": "stacks-queues", "title": "Stacks, Queues and Deques", "summary": "LIFO and FIFO ADTs, array implementations, circular buffers and delimiter matching.", "lessons": [{"id": "stacks", "title": "Stacks and their applications", "file": "10-stacks.md", "words": 2426}, {"id": "queues-deques", "title": "Queues, circular arrays and deques", "file": "11-queues-deques.md", "words": 2871}], "problems": ["dsaf-array-stack", "dsaf-circular-queue"]}, {"id": "linked-lists", "title": "Linked Lists", "summary": "Singly, circular and doubly linked lists, the positional list ADT, move-to-front.", "lessons": [{"id": "singly-circular", "title": "Singly and circularly linked lists", "file": "12-singly-circular.md", "words": 2660}, {"id": "doubly-positional", "title": "Doubly linked lists and positional lists", "file": "13-doubly-positional.md", "words": 2718}, {"id": "mtf-tradeoffs", "title": "Access frequencies, move-to-front and link vs array", "file": "14-mtf-tradeoffs.md", "words": 2396}], "problems": ["dsaf-linked-deque", "dsaf-move-to-front"]}, {"id": "trees", "title": "Trees", "summary": "General and binary trees, properties, representations, traversals, Euler tours, expression trees.", "lessons": [{"id": "tree-basics", "title": "Tree terminology, ADTs and representations", "file": "15-tree-basics.md", "words": 2628}, {"id": "tree-traversals", "title": "Traversals, Euler tours and expression trees", "file": "16-tree-traversals.md", "words": 2629}], "problems": ["dsaf-tree-traversals", "dsaf-expression-tree"]}, {"id": "priority-queues", "title": "Priority Queues and Heaps