-sort.md", "words": 3057}, {"id": "lower-bound-linear", "title": "The sorting lower bound and linear-time sorts", "file": "28-lower-bound-linear.md", "words": 2717}, {"id": "selection", "title": "Comparing sorts and selection", "file": "29-selection.md", "words": 2739}], "problems": ["dsaf-merge-sort-inversions", "dsaf-quicksort-inplace", "dsaf-quickselect", "dsaf-radix-sort"]}, {"id": "text", "title": "Text Processing", "summary": "Brute force, Boyer-Moore, KMP; dynamic programming (matrix chain, LCS); Huffman; tries.", "lessons": [{"id": "pattern-matching", "title": "Pattern matching: brute force, Boyer-Moore, KMP", "file": "30-pattern-matching.md", "words": 2758}, {"id": "dynamic-programming", "title": "Dynamic programming: matrix chain and LCS", "file": "31-dynamic-programming.md", "words": 2290}, {"id": "huffman-tries", "title": "Greedy compression and tries", "file": "32-huffman-tries.md", "words": 2669}], "problems": ["dsaf-kmp-failure", "dsaf-kmp-search", "dsaf-lcs", "dsaf-matrix-chain", "dsaf-huffman-cost", "dsaf-trie"]}, {"id": "graphs", "title": "Graph Algorithms", "summary": "Graph ADT and representations, DFS/BFS, transitive closure, DAGs, Dijkstra, MSTs, union-find.", "lessons": [{"id": "graph-representations", "title": "Graphs and their representations", "file": "33-graph-representations.md", "words": 2319}, {"id": "graph-traversals", "title": "DFS, BFS, transitive closure and DAGs", "file": "34-graph-traversals.md", "words": 2709}, {"id": "shortest-paths", "title": "Weighted graphs and Dijkstra's algorithm", "file": "35-shortest-paths.md", "words": 2783}, {"id": "mst-union-find", "title": "Minimum spanning trees and union-find", "file": "36-mst-union-find.md", "words": 2485}], "problems": ["dsaf-topological-order", "dsaf-dijkstra", "dsaf-mst-weight", "dsaf-union-find"]}, {"id": "memory", "title": "Memory Management and B-Trees", "summary": "Allocation, garbage collection, memory hierarchies, caching policies, B-trees, external sorting.", "lessons": [